      en: ["Pehcovo is situated at an average altitude of approximately 1000 meters above sea level.", "The Judovi Livadi waterfalls are located in the vicinity of the town.", "The region is known for its deposits of iron ore and quartz.", "Pehcovo served as a 'kaza' administrative center during the Ottoman period.", "The average annual temperature is around 9 degrees Celsius due to its elevation.", "The Bregalnica River has its source in the mountains above the town."],
